tories which varies year to year. \n3: Prescribed date for submission of return s to Labour Bureau by the State \nGovernments for the year 2019 is 30th April, 2020. \n \n \n \n \n \n \nAnnex-I \n \n \nAnnexure referred to in reply to Part (b) to (e ) of Lok Sabha Un-starred \nQuestion No. 173  to be answered on 03/02/2020  raised by Dr Shrikant \nEknath Shinde & others regarding Maternity Benefit Act.  \n \n \nWORKING OF THE MATERNITY BENEFIT ACT, 1961 DURING THE YEAR 2014 to \n2016. \nYears \nNumber \nof \nestablish\nments \ncovered \nby the \nMaternity \nBenefit \nAct \nNumber of \nestablishme\nnts \nsubmitting \nreturns \nAggregate No. \nof women \nworkers \nemployed daily \nin \nestablishments \nsubmitting \nreturns \nNo. of \nwomen who \nclaimed \nmaternity \nbenefit \nduring the \nyear \nNo. of \nclaims \naccepted \nand paid \neither fully \nor partially    \nTotal \namount of \nmaternity \nbenefits \npaid \nincluding \nbonus  (in \nRs.). \n1 2 3 4 5 6 7 \n2014 149231 27560 799142 35035 32782 606332847 \n2015 88310 26558 969259 41123 24260 685581169 \n2016 82361 23371 924017 31568 28591 251743001 \n\n \n \nAnnex-II \nAnnexure referred to in reply to Part (b) to (e) of Lok Sabha Un-starred Question No. 173 \nto be answered on 03/02/2020 raised by Dr Shrikant Eknath Shinde & others regarding \nMaternity Benefit Act.  \n \nNumber of complaints received and prosecutions launched (By States) during the year 2014 to 2016 \n \nYears \nNo. of \ncomplaints \nreceived \nNo. of \ncomplaints/establshment \ninvestigated \nNo. of \nprosecutions \nlaunched \nNo. of \nconvictions \nobtained \nAmount  \nof fine \n levied \n(Rs.)  \n1 2 3 4 5 6 \n2014 17 710 9 16 34700 \n2015 6 3 9 5 20000 \n2016 - 636 2 7 25000 \n \nNote: 1:  Above figure relates to the Factories, Plantations, Mines and Other Establishments \nduring the said year. \n2:  The report is based on the information received from different States and  Union \nTerritories which varies year to year. \n3: Prescribed date