��\n������ ��������������������������������������������������������������������������������\n����������������������������������������������������������������"}, {"k": "questions|ls|17|3|UNSTARRED |259", "t": "Entrepreneurship among SCs", "head": "GOVERNMENT OF INDIA \nMINISTRY OF DEFENCE \nDEPARTMENT OF DEFENCE PRODUCTION \nLOK SABHA \nSTARRED QUESTION NO. 259 \nTO BE ANSWERED ON 11th March, 2020 \n \nREVIEW OF PERFORMANCE OF DEFENCE PSUs \n*259. SHRI BIDYUT BARAN MAHATO: \n          SHRI SANJAY SADASHIV RAO MANDLIK: \nWill the Minister of DEFENCE j{kk ea=h  \nbe pleased to state: \n (a) the details of the Defence Public Sector  Undertakings (PSUs) engaged in \nshipbuilding in the country; \n(b) whether the Government has recently reviewed the performance of such PSUs; \n(c) if so, the details and the outcome thereof; \n(d) whether these PSUs are also exporting their products to various countries; \n(e) if so, the details thereof along with the revenue  generated through exports during \nthe last three years, country-wise; and \n(f) the steps taken/being taken by the Government  to improve the performance of such \nPSUs? \n \n \nA    N    S    W    E    R \n \nMINISTER OF DEFENCE                                    (SHRI RAJNATH SINGH) \n      j{kk ea=h                  ¼Jh राजनाथ स िंह ) \n \n \n(a) to (f):  A Statement is laid on the Table of the House. \n******* \n  \n\nSTATEMENT REFERRED TO IN REPLY TO  PARTS (a) TO ( f) OF LOK \nSABHA STARRED QUESTION NO. 25 9 FOR ANSWER ON 11.03.2020 \nREGARDING ‘REVIEW OF PERFORMANCE OF DEFENCE PSUs’.  \n(a)  The details of four Defence PSUs engaged in shipbuilding are as under:- \nMazagon Dock Shipbuilders Limited (MDL), Mumbai:- \nMazagon Dock Shipbuilders Limited, incorporated as a Defence PSU Shipyard on        \n14th May, 1960 constructs warships and submarines for Indian Navy and Indian Coast \nGuard.  MDL is a Mini-Ratna category I company. \nGoa Shipyard Limited (GSL), Goa:- \nGoa Shipyard Limited established in 1957, 