HA STARRED \nQUESTION NO.*329 TO BE ANSWERED ON 17.03.2020   \n \n(a) to (c): To achieve the objective of “Housing fo r All” by 2022, Ministry of Rural \nDevelopment has been implementing Pradhan Mantri Aw aas Yojana-Gramin (PMAY-G) \n(restructured from the erstwhile Indira Awaas Yojana (IAY) with effect from 01.04.2016.  \nThe Central Government allocates targets and funds to the State as a unit and the further  \nsub-allocation of targets and funds to Districts/Gr am Panchayat/Villages is made by the \nState Government itself.  \n \nIn the Tirunelveli district under PMAY-G, 7,102 hou ses have been constructed against \nthe target of 13,175 as on 12.03.2020.  The Central  Government releases to  Tamilnadu \nState during the last four financial years are as under:-  \n \nS.No. Financial Year Amount of Central Release \n(in lakhs) \n \n1. 2016-17 69059.770 \n2. 2017-18 84848.578 \n3.  2018 -19  50279.810  \n4.  2019 -20  48752.12  \n \n \nA Statement indicating district-wise details, inclu ding Tirunelveli District, of number of \nbeneficiaries, funds allocated, disbursed and utili zed in the State of Tamil Nadu under \nPMAY-G is given at Annexure-I\n. \n \n \n******* \n\nAnnexure-I \n \nSTATEMENT IN REPLY TO PART (a) to (c) OF LOK SABHA STARRED QUESTION \nNO.*329 TO BE ANSWERED ON 17.03.2020   \n \nDistrict-wise details of beneficiaries, target set by State, houses constructed, funds \nallocation and utilized in respect of the State of Tamil Nadu  \n�� �� (Units in Nos.) (Rs. in Lakhs) \nS \nN\no \nDistrict Beneficiaries    \nin PWL \nPhase I  Phase II  Cumulat \nive \nTarget \nCumulati \nve Houses \nConstru-\ncted \nFunds \nAllocated \nFunds \nUtilized (2016-17 to 2018-19) (2019-20) \nTarget \nHouses \nConstructed \nTarget \nHouses \nConstru \ncted \n1 Ariyalur 30459 9272 4948 8679 52 17951 5000 21541 .2 7791.6074 \n2 Coimbatore 3441 1588 1492 3289 187 4877 1679 5852 .4 2177.8013 \n3 Cuddalore 51860 17733 7481 16709 124 34442 7605 4 1330.4 12592.504 \n4 Dharmapuri 